==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 5~6.67 seconds<sup>150f~200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 30~60 seconds<sup>900f~1,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 200 seconds<sup>6,000f</sup>, delay 66.67~133.33 seconds<sup>2,000f~4,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 30~60 seconds<sup>900f~1,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 30~60 seconds<sup>900f~1,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 30~60 seconds<sup>900f~1,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 30~60 seconds<sup>900f~1,800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 70% HP:
**1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 50% HP:
**1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 30% HP:
**1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Begin the battle by upgrading the [[Worker Cat]]. When the enemies come near the [[Cat Base]], send out a few [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Tank Cats]] as you upgrade your [[Worker Cat]] to max level. When Baa Baa appears, start sending out [[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Axe Cats]] to take care of the Baa Baas and Jackie Pengs. Spawn [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|Bird Cat]] when Gory comes. Gory's death will provide you with lots of money, so just send out all of your [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]]. Focus on spawning meatshields, Axe Cats and [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Fish Cats]]. This way, you will be prepared to face all of the Sir Seals.

Note that the Sir Seals can be fought one at a time provided you don't damage to the base too much too quickly. If you find yourself facing too many Sir Seals at once, try to play less aggressively.

