==Trivia==
*In the [[Nyanko Daisensou|Japanese version]], this stage takes place in '''Chiba Prefecture'''.
*Chiba Prefecture's base is a reference to the [[wikipedia:Partners (statue)|''Partners'']] statue at [[wikipedia:Tokyo Disneyland|Tokyo Disneyland]] in Uruyasu, Chiba.

